  "milestone": null,
  "body": "## Summary\n\nPR #28483 added `sai_fec_stats_cumulative=1` soc variable for Nokia BCM DNX platforms to fix fabric counter accumulation (tracked in #23806).\n\nSimilar changes are needed for **Arista BCM DNX platforms** to ensure fabric port counters are accumulated correctly.\n\n## Reference\n- PR #28483: Nokia/BCM DNX fix\n- Issue #23806: Fabric counters not accumulated\n- BCM fix available in SAI 14.1 and SAI 15.2\n\n## Work needed\nApply equivalent `sai_fec_stats_cumulative=1` configuration for Arista BCM DNX platform profiles.",
  "comments": [
